# Psychic powers catalog

Codex **psychic powers** (the named powers a Psyker may use each turn) are stored in `PsychicPower` and linked to units via `BasePsychicPower` (`AbilityValue` when parameterized).

```
✅ PsychicPower + BasePsychicPower     ❌ SpecialAbility + BaseSpecialAbility
✅ Warp Field, Synaptic Beacon         ❌ listing those under abilities=[...]
✅ Kind = "Psychic Power" in the app
```

In seed generators, put them on `PSYCHIC_POWERS` / `psychic_powers=[...]`, not `ABILITIES` / `abilities=[...]`.

Keep related **traits and attack flags** as `SpecialAbility`:

```
✅ Psyker, Psychic Save (X+), Psychic Attack, Psychic Abomination
```

Show powers in a separate **Psychic powers** section on base detail (only when the unit has any). Rule detail / Rules search use kind `Psychic Power`.
